description: Atomic PRs on the jslay88 fork; never commit ROM-derived files
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git and PRs

- One concern per PR. Stack or sequence: build/compiler fixes, then features, then docs.
- Target `master` on `jslay88/zelda3`. Create with `gh pr create --repo jslay88/zelda3 --base master --head <branch>`. Bare `gh pr create` opens against `snesrev/zelda3`.
- Short imperative commit subjects. No agent attribution trailers.
- Stage named files only. Never `git add -A`, `git add .`, `git add -f`, or `--no-verify`.
- Before commit: `bash scripts/check-no-copyrighted-assets.sh` must print `OK`. If it lists a path, unstage and stop.
